
Uhlu uma-kufika: ['sum'] yenza: {
	>> total := 0.
	uqobo ngamunye: { :index :element
		total engeza: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Uhlu ← 9 ; 8 ; 7.
Okuphumayo bhala: (a sum), umugqa-omusha. 
>> a := Uhlu ← 1 ; 9.
Okuphumayo bhala: (a sum), umugqa-omusha. 
>> a := Uhlu ← ['o'] ; 2.
Okuphumayo bhala: (a sum), umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (Uhlu okusha sum), umugqa-omusha. 
